- ADV-P1-4k (F8): backslash and noncanonical manifest paths are rejected with a clear error, so an actor's art is never silently dropped.
- ADV-P1-4i, 4j and 4l stay green. N1 (stale staging folders) is recorded as tech debt at track close in the plan.
